    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/786d1b93c00b32e18b9841919e9f05b0.avif?t=1740543401\" /></div>Air VR is a new virtual reality game with an emphasis on hyper mobile combat mechanics. Choose from 4 unique classes and climb up a procedurally generated 1-4 player co-op PvE experience or enter the arena for 2-8 player PvP and see who comes out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.poster.avif?t=1740543401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.webm?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.mp4?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE WEAPON CLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from four available classes, each with a unique movement mechanic. Jump, fly, sling, and teleport using your class weapon to climb to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP PVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate procedurally generated levels that take you up into the sky. Defeat monsters and huge bosses as you travel up through the caves and onto the surface solo or with a friend up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.poster.avif?t=1740543401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.webm?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.mp4?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEATHMATCH PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena with 2-8 players and fight to see who will come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vertical procedurally generated levels and fight waves of monsters to climb up and onto the surface and into the sky! Every playthrough is generated differently for a unique experience each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your appearance quickly and easily. Collect skins to create your perfect avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/786d1b93c00b32e18b9841919e9f05b0.avif?t=1740543401\" /></div>Air VR is a new virtual reality game with an emphasis on hyper mobile combat mechanics. Choose from 4 unique classes and climb up a procedurally generated 1-4 player co-op PvE experience or enter the arena for 2-8 player PvP and see who comes out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.poster.avif?t=1740543401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.webm?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/db855017b530cf57574d5c475c715e9c.mp4?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE WEAPON CLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from four available classes, each with a unique movement mechanic. Jump, fly, sling, and teleport using your class weapon to climb to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP PVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate procedurally generated levels that take you up into the sky. Defeat monsters and huge bosses as you travel up through the caves and onto the surface solo or with a friend up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.poster.avif?t=1740543401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.webm?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551370/extras/c76d8e7b98f0b44bf8038977ec435742.mp4?t=1740543401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEATHMATCH PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena with 2-8 players and fight to see who will come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vertical procedurally generated levels and fight waves of monsters to climb up and onto the surface and into the sky! Every playthrough is generated differently for a unique experience each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your appearance quickly and easily. Collect skins to create your perfect avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Air VR is a virtual reality shooter where you fly, jump, and fight monsters and other players. Choose a weapon class and climb up procedurally generated levels in 1-4 player co-op PVE or enter the arena for 2-8 player deathmatch PVP.",
